{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41583","headline":"麻姑山 · 沈彬","name":"麻姑山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绀殿松萝太古山，仙人曾此话桑田。\n闲倾云液十分日，已过浮生一万年。\n花洞路中逢鹤信，水帘岩底见龙眠。\n我来游礼酬心愿，欲共怡神契自然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41583.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41583","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}